re considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Vomiting was also examined as an isolated postnaloxone sign separate from the grouped opioid withdrawal signs and symptoms variable.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}